<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Script on Shirakii</title><link>https://siya-33.github.io/tags/script/</link><description>Recent content in Script on Shirakii</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Shirakii</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 02:52:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://siya-33.github.io/tags/script/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>用脚本在Directory Opus中解放双手</title><link>https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 01:35:03 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 用脚本在Directory Opus中解放双手" />&lt;p>我们在日常处理文件的过程中经常会遇到一些重复的劳动，用命令虽然快但有学习成本，而且始终没有图形界面的交互直观。今天稍微学习了下自定义脚本的步骤，记录下方便以后有人需要。当然，我估计才发挥出 &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.gpsoft.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Directory Opus&lt;/a> 百分之十的功能，更多的还是自己去挖掘吧。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>譬如把封面压缩成webp格式,或者是扩充背景这类重复操作我就可以一键完成了&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/images/1.gif"
width="912"
height="833"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="109"
data-flex-basis="262px"
> &lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/images/2.gif"
width="912"
height="833"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="109"
data-flex-basis="262px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>现在介绍下具体操作。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>依次点击设置-自定义工具栏和热键-用户命令-新建，我这里把类型改为了MS-DOS批处理功能&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/images/script.webp"
width="764"
height="505"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="151"
data-flex-basis="363px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">@nofilenamequoting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">magick &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;{filepath}&amp;#34;&lt;/span> -quality &lt;span class="m">80&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;{filepath|noext}.webp&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>点击确定后，别关闭自定义窗口，把脚本拖拽到想要的区域即可。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>之后只要选中想要的图片再点击按钮，当然想要更加有条理只要在代码上缝缝补补就可以了。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>需要动态的参数输入也很简单，以扩充背景为例&lt;/p>
&lt;details>
&lt;summary class="toggle-button">Resize&lt;/summary>
&lt;p>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">@set w={dlgstring|Enter Width (w)|1920}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">@set h={dlgstring|Enter Height (h)|1080}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">@nofilenamequoting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ffmpeg -i &amp;#34;{filepath}&amp;#34; -vf &amp;#34;scale=w={$w}:h={$h}:force_original_aspect_ratio=decrease,pad={$w}:{$h}:(ow-iw)/2:(oh-ih)/2:black&amp;#34; &amp;#34;{filepath|noext}_resized.jpg&amp;#34;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/details>
&lt;p>另外&lt;a class="link" href="https://resource.dopus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>论坛&lt;/a>也有很多大神分享的脚本代码，可以去官网上找。我当时下了这个软件也是一头雾水，建议慢慢按需添加功能，适合自己的才是最好的&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/do-script/images/3.webp"
width="2136"
height="1302"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="164"
data-flex-basis="393px"
>&lt;/p>
